Hot Reload vs Hot Restart
Hot Reload:
 Hot Reload applies code changes quickly while preserving the current app state. Developers use it to quickly see UI and code changes during development.
Hot Restart:
 Hot Restart restarts the Flutter application and resets its current state. Developers use it when they need the app to restart completely so that larger code changes can take effect.


